    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–3 Swarm Units</p><p>Interbred and gene-modified bee and wasp variations pollinate habitat gardens. Growing up to 8 centimeters, they live in large hives, produce honey, prey on other insects, and help with gardening. Some are trained for security or assassination, attacking when certain pheromonal cues are released.</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Enhanced Smell, Polarization Vision, Ultraviolet Vision</p><p><strong>Swarm:</strong> Bees and wasps use the rules given for Swarms (p.168). Stats given are for one swarm, not individual insects.</p><p><strong>Assassin Variant:</strong> Add Poison Gland with toxin of GM’s choice.</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 7 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 0, Death Rating 50.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 157.</em></p>",
